title: 'pallet-revive:  delete trie row on variable-key set_storage(key, &[])'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: "Fix #11946 : route an empty value buffer in the variable-key `api::set_storage`\
    \ syscall to `Ext::set_storage(.., None)` so the entry is deleted via `child::kill`,\
    \ matching the documented `Ext` contract and the fixed-key `set_storage_or_clear(key,\
    \ ZEROS)` path.\r\n"
crates:
- name: pallet-revive-fixtures
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: patch
- name: pallet-revive-uapi
  bump: patch
